      "object 28": {
        "ID": 28,
        "gui": {
          "x": "580.0",
          "y": "230.0",
          "w": "300"
        },
        "parms": "2. Every message sends from three outlets, right to left: the whole state, the item's name, then its number. The boxes under the menu show them. For a single choice the state is just the number again.",
        "type": ".text"
      },
      "object 29": {
        "ID": 29,
        "gui": {
          "x": "580.0",
          "y": "330.0",
          "w": "300"
        },
        "parms": "3. Pick saw or noise from the menu with the mouse: the boxes follow. The radiogroup and the tab are separate objects, so clicking them changes only themselves. A number outside the list, or a name that is not an item, is ignored.",
